# text
# c1: group_tolerance_s
seg-f5117c42f7b2 = Rows with the same time (within <c1/>) are one epoch, so long and wide exports both work, and position rows interleaved with satellite rows join their epoch.

# text
# c1: null
seg-8bf34b10f1f9 = An empty cell (or a JSON <c1/>) is a missing value; anything else that is not a number is an error naming the line and the column. Nothing is guessed.

# text
seg-1e2748d6399d = Times must not go backwards; a row that does is an error naming it, never a silent reorder.

# text
# c1: time_label
seg-c0ee7cf97ecc = GPS and TAI times are converted to UTC with the leap-second table; the observation file's <c1/> is UTC.

# text
