# c1: kshana connect watch <dir> --mapping <connect.toml> --station <station.toml>
# c2: --interval
# c3: --suffix
# c4: .csv
# c5: --once
seg-50fdf6362023 = From the command line: <c1/> prints new records as JSON lines every <c2/> seconds (default { "2" }). <c3/> picks the files (default: the mapping's format, for example <c4/>). <c5/> reads what is there, releases the last epoch and exits.

