seg-0877d73f996c = <c1/> replays the conformance vectors over MQTT, WebSocket and the directory watch and checks ordering, holding, reconnection and latency. The rules are in <a1><c2/></a1>. On the bundled vectors every path passes, with a 99th-percentile latency of a few milliseconds on a laptop.

